1n9r|n|The cry of the duck, or a sound in imitation of it; a hoarse, quacking noise. ; A boastful pretender to medical skill; an empiric; an ignorant practitioner. ; Hence, one who boastfully pretends to skill or knowledge of any kind not possessed; a charlatan.	v:1s99,31,1~1s99,31,1
